  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Disabling shaders for Trusted or Veteran users, then turning them back on will sometimes break certain shaders until you rejoin the world or restart your client. This only affects the model the user was on at the time of the change, and will carry over the updated settings to any model they switch to.\n\nTo reproduce:\nFind a trusted/vet user using an MMD model with different shaders for face/body, clothes, etc.\n\nDisable shaders to remove shaders.\n\nEnable again and certain shaders will not return to normal. Had the face stay the standard shader but others re-enable properly.\n\nRejoining the world fixes it.",
